It seems that heatmap function from MSstats is not applicable to your data. Because heatmaps in MSstats require at least two comparisons but your data has only one comparison (ACO-HA). The heatmaps in MSstats is to illustrate up-/down-regulated proteins for multiple comparisons with all proteins. Each row represents each protein. Each column represents each comparison of interest. So it needs at least two columns (two comparisons).

